{
  "uid": "memoire-infra",
  "title": "Memoire — infrastructure et appli de test",
  "description": "Tableau de bord M4 : ce que l'infrastructure et l'appli de test produisent, et les fenetres d'injection qui permettent de les lire. Le score d'anomalie, les alertes, les derives confirmees et la version du modele en service arrivent avec le service de detection (M5), sur un second tableau de bord. Fichier provisionne depuis le depot : toute modification se fait dans infra/grafana/dashboards/, pas dans l'interface.",
  "tags": [
    "memoire",
    "m4"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Etat de l'experience",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Version deployee",
      "description": "Une derive reelle S1 est un deploiement. Cette serie date le changement de version dans les donnees elles-memes, au lieu de le noter a la main apres coup.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "app_build_info",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{version}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latence de base declaree",
      "description": "Valeur annoncee par le deploiement courant, a comparer au p50 observe.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "app_base_latency_ms",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "ms"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Injections applicatives en cours",
      "description": "1 pendant une injection, 0 sinon. Sert a situer les fenetres d'anomalie sur les autres panneaux, et a recouper le fichier d'etiquettes contre ce que l'appli a reellement subi.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1.2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "app_chaos_active",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Appli de test",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requetes par seconde, par statut",
      "description": "Le plan de controle est exclu : il ne subit pas les injections, et le compter melangerait le trafic mesure avec les sondes de sante.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 35,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(app_requests_total{endpoint!~\"/health|/metrics|/chaos.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latence de service : p50 et p95",
      "description": "Les deux quantiles demandes au §4.2. Une injection de latence deplace d'abord le p95 : c'est pour cela que les bornes de l'histogramme sont resserrees sous 100 ms.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(app_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint!~\"/health|/metrics|/chaos.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(app_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint!~\"/health|/metrics|/chaos.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Part de reponses 5xx",
      "description": "Deux protections, pour deux trous differents, tous deux constates sur la pile reelle. `or vector(0)` au numerateur : sans aucune reponse 5xx, la somme ne renvoie aucune serie et le panneau restait vide alors que la bonne reponse est zero. `clamp_min` au denominateur : sans trafic du tout, le rapport vaudrait 0/0. Dans les deux cas, un trou se confondrait avec un taux d'erreur nul, c'est-a-dire avec l'absence d'anomalie.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(app_requests_total{endpoint!~\"/health|/metrics|/chaos.*\",status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(app_requests_total{endpoint!~\"/health|/metrics|/chaos.*\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.001)",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "part 5xx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
